From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:21:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): add persistent main-zone top contributions
 [daveey]

Render workspace.mainTop below the workspace zone's own titlebar/header,
not above the whole layout. The area is exported through the SDK barrel,
ordered, zero-height for null content and outside the active pane lifecycle.
Shell topStrip remains unchanged. Extract the existing window-controls drag
band to keep TreeGroup under its code-health ceiling.

Proof: new renderer tests fail 4/4 on base 3674f5e146 and pass on the fix.
Renderer regression tests and shell topStrip tests pass; tsc passes;
scripts/check --base origin/main passes all 21 gates. Browser geometry and
full-renderer screenshots are additional acceptance checks on the owner card.

