 ### Shell top strip
 
+`MAIN_PANE_TOP_AREA` mounts only in the zone containing the permanent `workspace`
+pane, after that zone's titlebar/tab header and before its active pane body. It
+stays mounted across session switches and chat ↔ page navigation. Contributions
+render in `order`, fill the zone's width, and reserve no space when absent or
+returning `null`. Sidebar and side-panel zones keep their existing geometry;
+this area never reserves a window-wide titlebar band. For a bounded expanded
+body, measure the enclosing `[data-tree-group]` rather than the window height.
+Older hosts may not export this constant: import the SDK namespace and fall
+back to `sdk.TOP_STRIP_AREA || 'shell.topStrip'` if needed, registering only once.
+
